# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin (forge fix 2, the owner: "warhat helms look alike at 1x; make the variants bolder"): `when
# helmfam-warhat,<mass>` replace views, one bold outline per body-mass class (the first replacing view that holds wins).
# the great kasa: a wide lacquered umbrella hat whose brim droops past the shoulders, lit ribs on its sunny side; the
# gat: a tall drum crown on a flat brim (a lacquered top hat), a band at its foot, a red tassel at the side; round and drop
# keep the base dome.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/d2.py (D R drawn; U is D with the face details dropped; L is R mirrored and re-lit).
# the great kasa (broad, tall)
view D key rest origin 4 3 when helmfam-warhat,variant-1 replace
mark crown 11 0
mark socket 11 0
